<!-- Per [[MOS:BOLDTITLE]] the following should NOT be bolded. -->''[[Ultimate Spider-Man (TV series)|Ultimate Spider-Man]]'' is an animated television series based on the superhero [[Spider-Man]]. The series premiered on [[Disney XD]] on April 1, 2012, airing alongside the second season of ''[[The Avengers: Earth's Mightiest Heroes]]'', as part of the ''Marvel Universe'' block. The series is based on the ''[[Ultimate Spider-Man]]'' comic book series.

{{Aired episodes|2012|4|1|2017|1|7|showpage=Ultimate Spider-Man (TV series)|seasons=4|finished=all}}

