=== Season 4: vs. the Sinister 6 (2016–17) ===
On June 1, 2015, it was announced that the series has been renewed for a fourth season, retitled ''Ultimate Spider-Man vs the Sinister 6''.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2015/06/marvels-avengers-ultimate-spider-man-disney-xd-orders-new-seasons-1201435839/|title=Disney XD Orders More Spider-Man & Avengers&nbsp;— With Some New Bad Guys|publisher=Deadline|date=June 1, 2015|access-date=June 2, 2015}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.ign.com/articles/2015/06/01/avengers-assemble-and-ultimate-spider-man-renewed-and-re-titled|title=Avengers Assemble and Ultimate Spider-Man Renewed and Re-Titled|publisher=IGN|date=June 1, 2015|access-date=June 2, 2015}}</ref> The season premiered with a one-hour episode titled "Hydra Attacks" on February 21, 2016.<ref name="cbr.com">{{Cite web|url=http://www.cbr.com/new-spider-man-animated-series-to-debut-in-2017/|title=NYCC: New Spider-Man Animated Series to Debut in 2017|date=October 8, 2016}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|last1=McLennan|first1=Cindy|title=Spider-Man and The Avengers Return in New Seasons to Disney XD|url=http://tvseriesfinale.com/tv-show/spider-man-and-the-avengers-return-in-new-seasons-to-disney-xd/|website=TV Series Finale|date=January 20, 2016|access-date=January 20, 2016}}</ref>

